\begin_layout Standard
作为具体模型，我们考虑处于 
\begin_inset Formula $s_{1/2}$
\end_inset

 与 
\begin_inset Formula $p_{1/2}$
\end_inset

 能级中的三个价核子系统（如
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand ref
reference "fig:9.10"
plural "false"
caps "false"
noprefix "false"
nolink "false"

\end_inset
所示）。在全部组态中，具有负宇称且自旋向上的物理纯费米子态仅有一个：
\begin_inset Formula 
\[
|\alpha\rangle = a_{s \frac{1}{2}}^\dagger a_{s -\frac{1}{2}}^\dagger a_{p \frac{1}{2}}^\dagger |D\rangle.
\]
\end_inset

该纯物理态相对于核芯 
\begin_inset Formula $|D\rangle$
\end_inset

 的能量期望值可以直接计算求得：
\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{align*}
\langle \alpha | H | \alpha \rangle - \langle D | H | D \rangle &= \epsilon + v_{s \frac{1}{2} s -\frac{1}{2}, s \frac{1}{2} s -\frac{1}{2}} + v_{s \frac{1}{2} p \frac{1}{2}, s \frac{1}{2} p \frac{1}{2}} + v_{s -\frac{1}{2} p \frac{1}{2}, s -\frac{1}{2} p \frac{1}{2}} \\
&= \epsilon + G + F + H.
\end{align*}
\end_inset

接下来我们需要计算两体激发态；假定双粒子剩余相互作用仅有对角矩阵元非零，我们可解出如下五个相关的两体 
\begin_inset Formula $\tau$
\end_inset

 模式：
\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{align*}
C_{s \frac{1}{2} p \frac{1}{2}}^{\tau_1} &= 1, \quad \Omega_{\tau_1} = \epsilon + F; \\
C_{s -\frac{1}{2} p \frac{1}{2}}^{\tau_2} &= 1, \quad \Omega_{\tau_2} = \epsilon + H; \\
C_{s \frac{1}{2} s -\frac{1}{2}}^{\tau_3} &= 1, \quad \Omega_{\tau_3} = G; \\
C_{s \frac{1}{2} p -\frac{1}{2}}^{\tau_4} &= 1, \quad \Omega_{\tau_4} = \epsilon + v_{s \frac{1}{2} p -\frac{1}{2}, s \frac{1}{2} p -\frac{1}{2}} := \epsilon + I; \\
C_{p \frac{1}{2} p -\frac{1}{2}}^{\tau_5} &= 1, \quad \Omega_{\tau_5} = 2\epsilon + v_{p \frac{1}{2} p -\frac{1}{2}, p \frac{1}{2} p -\frac{1}{2}} := 2\epsilon + J.
\end{align*}
\end_inset

对应的五种粒子-玻色子 
\begin_inset Formula $p\tau$
\end_inset

 组态展示于
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand ref
reference "fig:9.11"
plural "false"
caps "false"
noprefix "false"
nolink "false"

\end_inset
中。
\end_layout

